WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.500
[Dramatic synth music playing]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Thom: We don't have much time left before the perimeter collapses.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Celia: I know. The neural interface is stabilizing now.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.800
Thom: Can you reach her memory core through the satellite relay?

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Celia: Almost there... syncing visual sensors and quantum resonance.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.500
[Mechanical whirring and robotic footsteps echo]

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.200
Thom: This is our only shot at fixing the past.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Celia: Don't let go of the connection, whatever happens!

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
[Robotic vocalization] Memory reconstruct sequence engaged.
